WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.902
Our world lead brings us to Ukraine now.

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.070
The fight in the city

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.105
with Europe's largest

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:07.574
nuclear power plant, at example,

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.608
is intensifying,

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.043
according to Ukrainian officials. There.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:11.678
They say Russian cluster shells injure

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.713
eight civilians in a village nearby.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.281
Three were ambulance workers

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.449
who had responded to the scene

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.084
in a predictable refrain.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:18.918
Russia claims

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:19.619
it was targeting

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:20.520
deployment warrants

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.755
for Ukraine's military.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:22.322
Meanwhile,

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.523
northeast of Aparicio,

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.025
Ukraine says it's clawed back

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.993
significant ground in back mud.

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:28.228
CNN's Nic Robertson spoke

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.629
to Ukrainian commanders on the ground

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:31.331
who want to set the record straight

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.600
on which Russian troops retreated.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:34.934
First,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.671
at the vanguard

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.707
of Ukraine's most successful

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.242
offensive in months,

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:44.411
elite soldiers stormed

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:47.247
out of the US, made 113 troop

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:49.315
carrier near back much

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.151
over the following three days.

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.419
They would take back close

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:54.087
to two miles of eastern

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.622
Ukrainian territory.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:57.624
From Russian troops.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.325
Their commander explains.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.460
Dry ground.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.494
New U.S.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:01.895
attack

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:05.131
vehicles helping reverse months of losses

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:05.965
So

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:07.967
everything was planned

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.035
and calculated

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.136
and we had an advantage

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.472
because we used armored vehicles.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:13.206
This time,

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:14.774
the weather gave us a chance to use

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:15.742
all our might

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.911
and show what we're capable of doing.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.479
Yevgeny Prigozhin is saying

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.147
the reason new territory

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.483
is because the Russian forces ran away.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.818
Prigozhin

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:26.252
Prigozhin is a liar

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.721
because the first to flee were Wagner.

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:30.457
It is his unit that fled.

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:31.891
And our success is not due

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.359
to the fact that they fled,

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:33.960
but the fact that

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.095
we conducted a planned

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.396
assault by circumventing

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.131
and cutting them off.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:40.133
Actually, the unit he is bad mouthing

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.501
fought to the end.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.471
His Wagners were the first to flee

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:46.739
Cleaned up and back from the battle.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.174
Three young troop

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.543
commanders recalled the first moments

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:51.978
and their words.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.480
Which were you a nervous

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.548
you feel the shivers, Allez says.

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.584
Every sound scares you,

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:59.719
especially the whistle of a mortar shell

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:03.223
with their success losses to

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.258
to move to each other.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:05.525
It is

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:06.693
always painful

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.895
and hard to lose, Paul says.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:10.130
But it doesn't stop us.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.965
It makes us angrier,

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:14.100
tougher and gives us motivation

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.202
to go all the way and not stop.

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:20.206
Each of them knows more battles to come.

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:21.274
Morale.

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:23.276
They stand after each fight.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:25.478
Morale goes up and down,

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.714
then up again, Trudeau says.

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.983
You have to motivate them somehow.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.619
And this last battle

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:33.486
not done

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.522
when the Russians were pushed back.

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:36.456
They regrouped,

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.491
rushing in reinforcements.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.827
Not for the first time in the days

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:41.761
long fight.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:43.329
U.s.-made weapons

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:46.733
making a decisive difference this time.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:47.400
High mass

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.868
precision rockets

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:51.738
reserve their reserves or too far away.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.940
And this allowed us to destroy the enemy,

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.975
even as we approach them.

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.011
We used unmanned aerial vehicles

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:00.180
to see where they were concentrated,

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.848
which enabled us to use a hammer

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:03.116
for a precision strike.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.752
His battalion estimate

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.687
in their sector of the fight.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:10.590
Two to 300 Russian soldiers killed.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.525
But he is quick to acknowledge

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:14.294
those soldiers strengths

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:17.497
and says Prigozhin is wrong to discount

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:19.499
the Russian army

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.270
so their offensive was so successful

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.805
in the hours of this morning.

00:03:25.805 --> 00:03:28.374
Another attack was launched around back.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:29.976
Morton Our commanders aren't saying

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:31.110
how successful

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.645
this part of the offensive is being.

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:33.913
And interestingly,

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:34.581
they're not saying

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:35.281
whether or not it's

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.482
connected with the big, bigger

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:38.484
expected counter offensive.

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.353
But significantly, on that.

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:42.722
Russia's defense ministry is saying

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:44.390
we're not losing any ground

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:45.758
around Bachmann at the moment,

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:47.794
and that's unusual for them to come out

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:50.063
publicly and say that. Jake, All right.

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:51.698
Nic Robertson in eastern Ukraine for us.

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:52.432
Thank you so much.

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:53.466
Meanwhile, a brash Russian

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:55.568
warlord and Wagner Army chief

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:57.203
Yevgeny Prigozhin says

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:58.338
Ukraine's counteroffensive

00:03:58.338 --> 00:03:59.372
is already in full swing,

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:01.007
but Ukrainian President

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:01.941
Volodymyr Zelenskiy

00:04:01.941 --> 00:04:03.243
says his country needs, quote,

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.110
a bit more time

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.311
to launch its counter-offensive

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:05.745
while he waits

00:04:05.745 --> 00:04:08.181
for more Western aid to arrive.

00:04:08.214 --> 00:04:10.583
Ukraine has gotten a new major delivery,

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:11.317
Britain's modern,

00:04:11.317 --> 00:04:12.285
long range stealth

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:13.453
cruise missiles

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:15.188
capable of striking deep

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:17.557
into Russian held occupied territory,

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:19.525
which CNN's Jim Sciutto

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:20.560
was first to report

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.063
As Ukrainian forces

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:24.530
prepare

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.166
to launch a massive new counteroffensive.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.936
They now have a deadly new weapon

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:30.870
in their arsenal.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.071
CNN exclusively

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:32.839
first reported

00:04:32.839 --> 00:04:33.273
that Britain

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:33.973
has delivered

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:34.741
to Ukraine

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:36.009
its advanced storm

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:37.577
shadow cruise missiles,

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:39.512
the kind of long range capability

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:40.680
Kiev has long been

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.181
pleading for the donation

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:43.216
of these weapons systems

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:43.883
gives Ukraine

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:45.818
the best chance to defend themselves

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:47.820
against Russia's continued brutality.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.522
The storm shadow gives Ukrainian

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:51.124
forces the ability to strike

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:53.159
deep behind Russian lines.

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:54.527
A Western official called it

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:56.596
a proportionate response

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:57.730
to Russia's targeting

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.299
of civilian infrastructure.

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.401
However, Ukrainian forces have pledged

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:02.468
to fire the missiles

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.603
only inside

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:05.638
Ukrainian sovereign territory,

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:07.674
not to attack Russia itself.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:08.474
While the U.S.

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:09.008
has so far

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:10.510
refused to provide Ukraine

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.011
with long range missiles,

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:13.713
such as the attackers

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:16.015
for fear of sparking Russian retaliation,

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:17.850
the UK has been more forward

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:18.885
leaning with its weapons

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.520
supplies in recent months.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.454
The UK provided

00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:23.690
modern Western challenger to tanks

00:05:24.891 --> 00:05:25.558
before the U.S.

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:27.960
decided to supply its own Abrams tanks.

00:05:28.194 --> 00:05:29.962
The storm shadow is a cruise missile

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:31.564
typically launched from the air

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:33.266
with stealth capabilities.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:36.569
It has a range in excess of 155 miles,

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:38.738
three times the range of U.S.

00:05:38.738 --> 00:05:39.972
provided missiles.

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:40.440
The Storm

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.641
Shadow's capability

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:43.676
is really complementary

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:44.143
to what

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:45.178
the Ukrainians

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:46.446
are planning to do

00:05:46.446 --> 00:05:48.514
with their spring offensive.

00:05:48.514 --> 00:05:52.051
It's able to use video imagery to target

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:54.587
actual areas that they're going after.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.355
Still, the U.S.

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:56.222
secretary of state

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:56.756
has said that

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:58.191
Ukraine already has

00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:00.093
what it needs to be successful.

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:03.262
My own estimation is that they

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:06.099
have in place

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:09.202
across all of those dimensions.

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:10.203
What they need to continue

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:11.270
to be successful

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.405
in regaining territory

00:06:12.405 --> 00:06:14.040
that was seized by force

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.008
by Russia over the last 14 months.

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:16.943
Ukrainian President

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:17.910
Vladimir Zelinsky,

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.011
on the other hand, has said

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:21.013
his country is not quite ready

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:23.049
saying he is still waiting for aid

00:06:23.216 --> 00:06:24.450
already promised.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.586
We're expecting armored vehicles.

00:06:26.586 --> 00:06:28.521
They arrive in batches.

00:06:28.521 --> 00:06:30.123
We can advance with what we've got.

00:06:30.123 --> 00:06:32.058
And I think we can be successful,

00:06:32.058 --> 00:06:33.926
but we will lose a lot of people.

00:06:33.926 --> 00:06:35.728
I think that is unacceptable.

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:36.662
We need to wait.

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:40.366
As I mentioned, Ukraine has pledged

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:43.169
to only use these new cruise missiles

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:46.105
inside Ukrainian sovereign territory.

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:48.007
That is not to strike Russia.

00:06:48.007 --> 00:06:49.409
We should note, Jake, that

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:50.910
from the British point of view,

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.514
Crimea is very much an open target here.

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:55.248
They consider that

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:57.016
illegally annexed by Russia.

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:58.284
And that's strategically important

00:06:58.284 --> 00:06:59.519
because these missiles

00:06:59.519 --> 00:07:00.420
potentially put at risk

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.088
some of Russia's most prized

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:03.089
military possessions,

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:04.824
the Black Sea fleet,

00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:06.959
the entire Crimea port.

00:07:06.959 --> 00:07:09.295
That could be a real game changer

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:10.963
going forward as Ukraine plans

00:07:10.963 --> 00:07:11.798
this counteroffensive.

00:07:11.798 --> 00:07:12.198
Yeah.

00:07:12.198 --> 00:07:12.632
Now,

00:07:12.632 --> 00:07:13.966
we could mark this day

00:07:13.966 --> 00:07:16.068
as as a day when decisions were made

00:07:16.402 --> 00:07:17.970
that really changed things for

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.372
for better or for worse.

00:07:19.372 --> 00:07:21.140
We don't know Computer, thanks so much.

